    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Exorcist</strong></p><p><strong>“This place holds.”</strong></p><p><strong>Strategic</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Scenario, negate one corruption-based penalty or hostile effect</li><li>reroll the lowest die on rolls involving purification, stabilization, or resisting Darkness</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> stability reduces flexibility; your faction may struggle with unconventional or adaptive approaches.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"exorcT3\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Negate Corruption</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Negate one corruption-based penalty or hostile effect.</div>\n</div>",
